WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Check your existing ChatGPT login. New users run codex login.

00:05.000 --> 00:17.000
Add the gateway provider. Read the virtual key from the environment.

00:17.000 --> 00:24.000
Start Codex and send a prompt using your subscription.

00:24.000 --> 00:34.500
The real response streams through LiteLLM.

00:34.500 --> 00:43.500
The gateway records token usage under the developer's virtual key.
